        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 87160, Edge Pull for Cabinets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Edge Pull can be mounted horizontally or vertically for use on kitchen cabinet doors or drawers. The Cabinet Edge Pull is available in modern finishes colors for your kitchen remodel. Choose from an array of sizes. The Hidden Cabinet Pull comes packaged with mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Hidden Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Bass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-87160-specifications.pdf?v=1704262431\"><b>Emtek Modern Edge Cabinet Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-87160:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-87100:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-87110:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-87120:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-87130:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-87140:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-87150:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86358-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354738\" width=\"510\" height=\"109\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
